OL,3,AGermany's far-right AfD says 'democracy
OL,4,Ademands' parties work with them after
OL,5,Astate election win
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe far-right Alternative for Germany
OL,8,F(AfD) is "very, very close" to taking
OL,9,Fpower, its deputy parliamentary leader
OL,10,Fhas told the BBC, after a historic
OL,11,Fvictory in elections for the eastern
OL,12,Fstate of Saxony-Anhalt.
OL,14,FSunday's preliminary results show it
OL,15,Ffell three seats short of an outright
OL,16,Fmajority, with 43.8% of the vote. It is
OL,17,Fnow seeking support from other parties
OL,18,For individuals in order to govern.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
