OL,3,AGermany's far-right AfD says 'democracy
OL,4,Ademands' parties work with them after
OL,5,Astate election win
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhile most German political parties
OL,8,Frefuse to work with the AfD, Beatrix
OL,9,Fvon Storch called for its opponents to
OL,10,Fenter talks and said: "You cannot say I
OL,11,Fdo not accept the vote of the people".
OL,13,FGermany's Chancellor Friedrich Merz
OL,14,Fsaid he was "deeply shocked" by the
OL,15,Fresult, describing it as "seismic...
OL,16,Fnot just in the country but also in my
OL,17,Fown political party and I take that
OL,18,Fvery seriously".
